1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,979
Look with your heart and truly see

2
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:35,960
The truth is not so far away

3
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:38,980
Hey you good or bad, true or false

4
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:41,980
No escaping the soul's gray haze

5
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,960
Take all of your bravery with you

6
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,140
Maybe you can save the world today

7
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,299
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

8
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:53,719
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

9
00:00:53,719 --> 00:00:56,679
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

10
00:00:56,679 --> 00:00:57,900
Mojo Spy

11
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:13,900
Dorothy told the other Illumin-Eye members about Lord Eye's past.

12
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:14,900
Lord Eye was originally a frustrated poet.

13
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:15,900
By chance, he came across a magical ancient book.

14
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:24,900
From then on, his life changed.

15
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:26,900
For Love and Ideals!

16
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,560
My eyes!

17
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,400
My eyes!

18
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:42,599
It hurts so much.

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,959
I am no ordinary mortal.

20
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:16,159
I am the king of the world!

21
00:02:22,199 --> 00:02:23,120
Oh my god~

22
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,280
So Lord Eye himself

23
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,780
had actually been through such a bumpy, rugged path

24
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:30,120
and such a wild, surreal adventure.

25
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,919
Mmm~ Dottie

26
00:02:31,919 --> 00:02:33,659
I want to hear your story too~

27
00:02:33,659 --> 00:02:37,920
So how did you meet Lord Illumin-Eye?~

28
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:40,460
Please, please tell me, okay?~

29
00:02:40,460 --> 00:02:44,659
Alright.

30
00:02:44,659 --> 00:02:46,639
Then I'll tell you.

31
00:02:46,639 --> 00:02:50,439
About the legendary, romantic way I met Lord Eye.

32
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,580
Back then, I was still a student.

33
00:02:54,580 --> 00:02:57,379
Every day, I had to be in that ugly school,

34
00:02:57,379 --> 00:03:01,379
putting up with those ugly people bossing me around.

35
00:03:23,379 --> 00:03:24,379
And you still paint it so flashy?

36
00:03:24,379 --> 00:03:26,379
Why not paint the still life the way it actually looks?

37
00:03:26,379 --> 00:03:29,379
Do you know what real, what gain, what art, what beauty even mean?

38
00:03:29,379 --> 00:03:30,379
So old-fashioned!

39
00:03:34,379 --> 00:03:36,379
I had plenty of admirers,

40
00:03:36,379 --> 00:03:40,379
but not one of them could ever truly get into my heart.

41
00:03:40,379 --> 00:03:42,379
Try mine!

42
00:03:42,379 --> 00:03:44,379
Try mine, Dottie!

43
00:03:45,379 --> 00:03:47,379
Try mine!

44
00:03:55,300 --> 00:03:56,300
So handsome! So cool!

45
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,299
Th-this-this-this-this-this!

46
00:04:09,299 --> 00:04:11,259
Who made this ugly food?!

47
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:18,980
Is it yours?

48
00:04:18,980 --> 00:04:22,339
S-sorry...

49
00:04:22,339 --> 00:04:23,379
I just...

50
00:04:23,379 --> 00:04:24,379
So cool, Dottie! So cool!

51
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:37,659
I admit

52
00:04:37,659 --> 00:04:41,040
perfect people are always the loneliest

53
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:49,899
Teacher, I protest!

54
00:04:49,899 --> 00:04:54,379
This poem is absolutely hideous

55
00:04:54,379 --> 00:04:55,800
I refuse to answer it

56
00:05:03,399 --> 00:05:04,439
That doesn't affect the exam

57
00:05:04,439 --> 00:05:05,420
Continue

58
00:05:22,459 --> 00:05:23,560
Dorothy

59
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,040
Get out of here!

60
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,400
In this ugly, filthy

61
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,960
squalid world

62
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,879
I walk alone

63
00:05:41,899 --> 00:05:42,340
Until one day

64
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:53,000
the simple sliced beef

65
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:56,919
always catches a fly landing on its shoulder unawares

66
00:05:58,899 --> 00:05:59,979
O lamentable fate!

67
00:05:59,979 --> 00:06:03,560
like a plush toy wrapped in packing tape

68
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,939
trembling before the air conditioner

69
00:06:05,939 --> 00:06:08,319
under the fluorescent light

70
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:10,879
the instant noodles sleeping in a stomach

71
00:06:10,879 --> 00:06:13,659
will never witness any of this

72
00:06:13,659 --> 00:06:16,060
O towering cargo shelf!

73
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:17,199
Do you know

74
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:19,479
my little sorrow

75
00:06:19,479 --> 00:06:21,879
in that moment

76
00:06:21,879 --> 00:06:25,360
I know, this is fate.

77
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,800
And I,

78
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:29,800
Like freshly cut air-flown sashimi,

79
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:33,060
Pristine and flawless,

80
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:34,360
If I may,

81
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:40,180
Could I have a word with you?

82
00:06:40,180 --> 00:06:42,779
After this destined encounter,

83
00:06:42,779 --> 00:06:44,560
Lord Eye told me

84
00:06:44,560 --> 00:06:47,139
of his grand plan to reopen the gates of civilization,

85
00:06:47,139 --> 00:06:49,120
to wash away this sinful old world

86
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:51,439
and turn it into a pure, beautiful

87
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:55,000
new world full of love and ideals.

88
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,920
Then,

89
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:01,040
Guided by Lord Eye, bright as the sun,

90
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,620
we founded our sacred organization together—

91
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:05,100
The Illumin-Eye—

92
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:06,540
step by step,

93
00:07:06,540 --> 00:07:09,279
to cleanse this ugly, filthy world.

94
00:07:21,439 --> 00:07:25,399
The Illumin-Night brings you happiness.

95
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:32,800
The Illumin-Eye: For Love and Ideals!

96
00:07:33,800 --> 00:07:34,360
Our organization, the Illumin-Night,

97
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:37,420
will bring love and happiness to everyone.

98
00:07:40,399 --> 00:07:41,939
Dottie~

99
00:07:41,939 --> 00:07:42,939
The Illumin-Eye: For Love and Ideals!

100
00:07:47,899 --> 00:07:49,860
But I don't understand.

101
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:53,319
Why does Lord Eye, already possessing such great power,

102
00:07:53,319 --> 00:07:54,720
still humble himself

103
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:57,240
to keep doing grunt work in this dumpy supermarket?

104
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,319
Getting bullied and exploited by the boss?

105
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,340
Idiot.

106
00:08:00,340 --> 00:08:02,139
Our organization's operating funds

107
00:08:02,139 --> 00:08:04,759
are all earned by Lord Eye working at the supermarket.

108
00:08:04,759 --> 00:08:08,000
And staying at the supermarket makes it easy to hide our identity.

109
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,639
And he can also directly borrow lots of the supermarket's goods

110
00:08:10,639 --> 00:08:11,819
for the organization's use.

111
00:08:11,819 --> 00:08:13,759
All of Lord Eye's blood and sweat

112
00:08:13,759 --> 00:08:16,879
is all for our great dream to come true!

113
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:19,220
O-oh, so that's how it is.

114
00:08:19,220 --> 00:08:20,820
As expected of Lord Eye!

115
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:22,780
So... so great!

116
00:08:22,780 --> 00:08:26,040
Shaky is so moved too!

117
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:30,740
What are you guys doing?

118
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,160
My Lord Eye!

119
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:40,259
Oh, Lord Eye!

120
00:08:40,259 --> 00:08:42,440
Your deeds are so touching!

121
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,740
You are our sun!

122
00:08:43,740 --> 00:08:46,279
To make our great organization's great dream come true,

123
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,300
you don't hesitate to humble yourself.

124
00:08:47,300 --> 00:08:48,899
Enduring every hardship, fearing no sacrifice,

125
00:08:48,899 --> 00:08:49,980
and burying your head in your work.

126
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:51,379
Everyone should learn from you, Lord Eye,

127
00:08:51,379 --> 00:08:52,620
the noble spirit of

128
00:08:52,620 --> 00:08:54,980
humbly serving as a willing ox!

129
00:08:54,980 --> 00:08:56,699
Lord Eye,

130
00:08:56,699 --> 00:08:57,759
please let your humble servant

131
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:58,799
serve you and all the people.

132
00:08:58,799 --> 00:08:59,860
Even through mountains of knives and seas of fire,

133
00:08:59,860 --> 00:09:00,759
I'll give everything I have

134
00:09:00,759 --> 00:09:02,039
and never shrink from anything!

135
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,600
Please, trust me

136
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,000
and give me an important role.

137
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,799
Everyone, from the depths of their souls,

138
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:13,559
holds you in deepest reverence!

139
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:15,360
My dear Lord Eye—

140
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:18,199
You... all of you!

141
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,160
Is everyone ready?

142
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:25,920
One, two, three—

143
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:26,980
Cheese!

144
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:27,980
Ending theme

145
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,420
It doesn't feel at all like

146
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:48,600
one person, lonely and alone.

147
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:52,039
Such is life—

148
00:09:52,039 --> 00:09:56,480
some unhappiness is hard to avoid.

149
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:59,680
A farewell ceremony

150
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:04,039
always leaves one feeling lost.

151
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:07,480
Look at tomorrow

152
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:11,779
Waving to me on your horizon

153
00:10:11,779 --> 00:10:15,519
Each day in sunrise and sunset

154
00:10:15,519 --> 00:10:19,480
Turning into time, dreaming of more

155
00:10:19,480 --> 00:10:21,980
Anticipating in life

156
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:24,539
Every second, every moment

157
00:10:24,539 --> 00:10:31,259
My bright eyes are sparkling

158
00:10:31,259 --> 00:10:34,620
Reflecting a smile of sunshine

159
00:10:34,620 --> 00:10:39,860
Stepping through the screaming crossroads

160
00:10:51,379 --> 00:10:52,339
No more hiding

161
00:10:52,339 --> 00:10:52,899
It's me

162
00:10:52,899 --> 00:10:54,419
So it's the Illumin-Eye after all

163
00:10:54,419 --> 00:10:56,099
Get rid of them